      "sender_id": 25,
      "content": "<p>Dear participants,</p>\n<p>Evaluation for Stage 2 is ongoing. Some results are now available on the main leaderboard. Congratulations to the participants who have achieved excellent results!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://competition.sair.foundation/competitions/mathematics-distillation-challenge-equational-theories-stage2/leaderboard\">https://competition.sair.foundation/competitions/mathematics-distillation-challenge-equational-theories-stage2/leaderboard</a></p>\n<p>We are still evaluating your submissions. If you have any questions about your results, please DM me, and we will arrange a review.</p>\n<p>The evaluation problems are now public:</p>\n<p>Main evaluation problems for stage 2:<br>\n<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/SAIRfoundation/equational-theories-selected-problems/viewer/stage2_evaluation_main\">https://huggingface.co/datasets/SAIRfoundation/equational-theories-selected-problems/viewer/stage2_evaluation_main</a></p>\n<p>Research evaluation problems for stage 2:<br>\n<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/SAIRfoundation/equational-theories-selected-problems/viewer/stage2_evaluation_research\">https://huggingface.co/datasets/SAIRfoundation/equational-theories-selected-problems/viewer/stage2_evaluation_research</a></p>\n<p>Thank you for participating in and supporting SAIR Competitions!</p>",
